Parameters  SENSITIVE
  The plan depends on the values: with $1 = 10001, $2 = 10, the generic plan does worse than the
  custom plan: pages 2,667 → 176,778 (66× more), execution 12.6 ms → 67.1 ms (5.3× slower).

  $1  integer, compared with orders.customer_id (=), held at 15453
  $2  bigint, the LIMIT, held at 10

  $1 = 15453  most common, 0.027% of rows
              the generic plan
  $1 = 10001  not among the most common, 0.005% of rows
              Parallel Seq Scan on orders, cost 5,095
              measured, custom plan → generic plan: pages 2,667 → 176,778 (66× more), execution 12.6
